* LT3045-1 3.3V Low-Dropout Regulator
V1 IN 0 5
C_IN IN 0 10u

* LT3045-1 Subcircuit Call
* Pins: IN, EN/UV, PG, ILIM, VIOC, SET, OUT, GND
X1 IN IN N_PG N_ILIM IN SET OUT 0 LT3045-1

* Pull-up for Power Good (PG)
R_PG N_PG IN 100k

* Current Limit Programming (~375mA limit to safely supply 100mA)
R_ILIM N_ILIM 0 400

* SET Pin Programming (100uA * 33k = 3.3V)
R_SET SET 0 33k
C_SET SET 0 10n

* Output Capacitor
C_OUT OUT 0 10u

* Load Resistor (3.3V / 100mA = 33 Ohms)
R_LOAD OUT 0 33

* Analysis directives
.tran 0 5m
.meas tran vout_dc avg V(OUT) from 4m to 5m

.end
